JkFlow 1.00 Wine PS4 runtime: prospero-win 108194e -> the shared source tree used by the Wine module builds

The Wine module builds (PW_ROOT of the order-284 runtime and of every later stage) read
this tree: the Wine patch series in wine/patches, the PS4 shims in wine/ps5, the x86
translator in src/ and the build tools in tools/. Includes new files. Not included: native/
and its test (the title's own sources, published under title/) and wine/patches-retired/
(superseded patch versions that no build applies).

